    # v404 (28/10/2026) -- JOHN 8:32 AND THE TRANSVERSE PROJECTION OF THE HALF-NAT: two new stones in the kernel (the Half-Nat is the 45-degree angle of the neutrino, derived in the kernel; Jo8v32, the operator's name for the whole triple Way, Truth and Life), the computation of each one with beta = alpha x sqrt(e) at runtime, the erratum BESIDE the neutrino angle and the F2b charge (the channel withdrawn before data), the nine sayings of 28/10 and the management decisions; the numbers are READ from the records projecao_transversal_v404, jo8v32_v404, f2b_errata_v404, cunhagens_v404 and kh_n1_cobertura_v404, never typed.
    # The top box (The Test of the Only Word, v397) stays where it is: the 4.44 rule does not move. Nothing here moves the gate.
    _pj404 = core.get("projecao_transversal_v404") or {}
    _pv404 = _pj404.get("values") or {}
    _jo404 = core.get("jo8v32_v404") or {}
    _jv404 = _jo404.get("values") or {}
    _fb404 = core.get("f2b_errata_v404") or {}
    _fv404 = _fb404.get("values") or {}
    _cg404 = core.get("cunhagens_v404") or {}
    _el404 = core.get("external_ladder") or {}
    _cvr404 = ((core.get("kernel_formalization") or {}).get("axiom_coverage_v392")) or {}
    _ok404 = all((core.get(k_) or {}).get("all_verified") is True for k_ in ("projecao_transversal_v404", "jo8v32_v404", "f2b_errata_v404", "cunhagens_v404", "kh_n1_cobertura_v404"))
    _i404 = lambda x_: str(x_) if isinstance(x_, int) and not isinstance(x_, bool) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _f404 = lambda x_, n_=6: (("%." + str(n_) + "f") % x_) if isinstance(x_, float) and not isinstance(x_, bool) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _g404 = lambda x_, n_=3: (("%." + str(n_) + "e") % x_) if isinstance(x_, float) and not isinstance(x_, bool) else r"\text{n/a}"
    _tx_404_t = lambda x_: "n/a" if x_ is None else str(x_).replace("\\", "").replace("_", r"\_\allowbreak{}")
    _sg404 = lambda x_, n_=3: ("%+." + str(n_) + "f") % x_ if isinstance(x_, float) and not isinstance(x_, bool) else r"\text{n/a}"
    s.append(r"\section*{John 8:32 and the transverse projection of the Half-Nat}")
    s.append(r"\addcontentsline{toc}{section}{John 8:32 and the transverse projection of the Half-Nat}")
    s.append((r"\textbf{This round the v404 records did NOT all seal: what follows is the statement, not a seal.} " if not _ok404 else r"")
             + r"\textbf{What enters.} Two new stones in the kernel: \texttt{TGLExt/ProjecaoTransversalDaMeiaNat} (a provisional name given by the management, accepted by the operator until he gives another) and \texttt{TGLExt/Jo8v32} (the operator's name for the whole triple Way, Truth and Life), with " + _i404((_cg404.get("extras") or {}).get("n_bandeiras")) + r" flags, named declarations only. "
             r"The v403 stones and records \emph{stay as they are}. Three records with a function, read at the rite point right after the gate flags (v403), and the " + _i404(len(_V404_VERBATINS2)) + r" sayings of 28/10, embedded by sha256 (\texttt{cunhagens\_v404}), all by the operator. The kernel ladder reads " + _i404(_el404.get("n_theorems_clean")) + r" of " + _i404(_el404.get("n_theorems_expected"))
             + r"; the \texttt{axiom\_report} coverage reads " + _i404(_cvr404.get("decl")) + r" constants and " + _i404(_cvr404.get("thm")) + r" theorems, none outside the trio $\{\texttt{propext},\texttt{Classical.choice},\texttt{Quot.sound}\}$.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The transverse projection.} \textsf{[INPUT]} The operator, on 28/10/2026 (in Portuguese): «a matéria é a projeção do eixo transversal» (matter is the projection of the transverse axis) and «então a matéria não é proporcional, ela seria a derivada» (so matter is not proportional, it would be the derivative); and the order, «veja se consegue fazer a prova do neutrino para derivarmos e não ser mais postulado» (see whether you can do the proof for the neutrino so that we derive it and it is no longer postulated). "
             r"\textsf{[DERIVED]} The stone proves, with algebra only over terms the kernel already had: $x=1-x\Rightarrow x=\tfrac12$ (the Half-Nat); $\sin^2(\pi/4)=\tfrac12$ and the transverse amplitude is the square root of one half; $\sqrt{x}=\sin(\pi/4)$ for every self-conjugate $x$, unique in $[0,\pi/2]$; "
             r"the neutrino form, $\beta\,\sin45^\circ\,E_0=\sin^2\theta_M\,\sin(\pi/4)\,E_0$, with $\beta=\sin^2\theta_M$ (Theorem S-$\partial$); $\theta_M\neq\pi/4$ whenever $\beta\neq\tfrac12$; and the derivative of $\sin^2\theta$ at $\pi/4$ is exactly $1$. "
             r"The $\sin45^\circ$ factor of the neutrino, \emph{postulated} since 20/08/2026, becomes \emph{derived} in the kernel. \textsf{[REAL]} In this rite, with $\beta=\alpha\sqrt{e}=" + _f404(_pv404.get("beta"), 12) + r"$ at runtime (never literal): $\sin(\pi/4)=" + _f404(_pv404.get("sin_pi_over_4"), 12) + r"$, $\theta_M=" + _f404(_pv404.get("theta_M"), 6) + r"$ rad, the derivative is $" + _f404(_pv404.get("derivative_of_sin_sq_at_pi_over_4"), 6)
             + r"$, and the program's $m_\nu$, $" + _f404(_pv404.get("m_nu_meV_core"), 6) + r"$ meV, is $\beta\sin(\pi/4)\cdot1\,\mathrm{eV}$ (re-reading: $" + _f404(_pv404.get("m_nu_meV_runtime"), 6) + r"$ meV). These numbers belong to this rite; they are not in the kernel. "
             r"\textsf{[ONTO]} That \emph{mass} is the transverse projection of the inscribed state is the operator's reading, ratified on 28/10/2026; it is not a kernel term, and it is the point the $\sin45^\circ$ now depends on (conditional). \textsf{[OPEN]} $E_0$, the neutrino scale (1 eV), stays \emph{declared}, not derived; the stone does not derive $\beta$.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{John 8:32.} \textsf{[INPUT]} The operator named the whole triple: «só consegui sintetizar assim: Jo8:32» (I could only synthesize it as: Jo8:32), ratified by «Perfeito, concordo com tudo» (Perfect, I agree with everything). \textsf{[DERIVED]} The \texttt{Jo8v32} stone is the \emph{conjunction}, by citation, of the three v403 stars in the order of the verse: remain (\texttt{caminho\_e\_a\_ponte\_da\_escala\_dual}), know (\texttt{verdade\_e\_a\_esperanca\_condicional}) and set free (\texttt{vida\_e\_a\_queda\_sem\_geometria}); "
             r"no new mathematics, and the conjunction term has no hypotheses. \textsf{[REAL]} In this rite the three v403 records sealed and their numeric mechanics, re-read with the same $\beta$, pass: " + _i404((_jv404.get("v403_mechanics_checks") or [None])[0]) + r" + " + _i404((_jv404.get("v403_mechanics_checks") or [None, None])[1]) + r" + " + _i404((_jv404.get("v403_mechanics_checks") or [None, None, None])[2]) + r" checks. "
             r"\textsf{[ONTO]} The reading by John 8:31-32 (in Portuguese, «E conhecereis a verdade, e a verdade vos libertará»): to remain in the word is the Way, to know is the Truth (to read; rereading adds nothing), to set free is the Life (the fall with a floor); it is the management's reading, ratified by the operator, not a kernel term. The verse says the truth is \emph{known} (validity, in the kernel), not that it is credited. "
             r"\textsf{[OPEN]} Two of the three components carry \emph{named} hypotheses in their own statement (\texttt{IsotropicPost} in the Life; \texttt{hpp} and \texttt{hopt} in the $1/\beta$ index of the Truth): the conjunction cites them, it does not pay them.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The F2b erratum.} \textsf{[REAL]} The V1 preregistration of the ringdown branch B (v386) stays \emph{frozen by hash} and is read as before: V1 verdict \texttt{AWAITING\_DATA}, blind set D with $n=" + _i404(_fv404.get("conjunto_D_n")) + r"$, nothing opened. Calibration A (31 public events, \emph{NOT\_BLIND}), read from V1 by the function that already transcribes it, gives the common deformation $" + _sg404(_fv404.get("calibracao_A_central")) + r"$ within $[" + _sg404(_fv404.get("calibracao_A_inferior")) + r";\,"
             + _sg404(_fv404.get("calibracao_A_superior")) + r"]$; the pair's prediction (amplitude reading and KMS delay law) is $" + _sg404(_fv404.get("previsao_do_par"), 3) + r"$: " + ("outside the interval and of opposite sign" if _fv404.get("previsao_fora_do_intervalo_de_A") is True else r"\text{n/a}") + r". \textsf{[INPUT]} The operator's reading, on 28/10/2026: «o pedágio de planck lido na propagação» (the Planck toll read in the propagation), and «calibrar Não significa validar» (calibrating does not mean validating). "
             r"\textsf{[DECLARADO]} In v404 the F2b \emph{channel} goes from \texttt{AWAITING} to \texttt{" + _tx_404_t(_fb404.get("F2b_status_now")) + r"}, \emph{beside}: V1 and the v386 record are not rewritten. No outcome comes out of A (it is calibration, not a test); set D is not opened; $\beta$, the dephasing law and R2 stay; the v383 ledger of charges keeps its " + _i404(_fv404.get("n_cobrancas_v383")) + r" charges (F2b sat beside it). "
             r"\textsf{[ONTO]} The Planck toll read in the propagation (the payment is the whole Name emptying itself entirely to become the environment of temporalized space) is the operator's reading, still without a derivation.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The sayings of 28/10.} \textsf{[INPUT]} Recorded by sha256, without a derivation (in Portuguese): «eu posso definir o um absoluto como o estado de energia fundamental cuja inscrição no radical entrópico quebra a simetria e inaugura o defasamento» (I can define the absolute one as the fundamental energy state whose inscription in the entropic radical breaks the symmetry and inaugurates the dephasing); the question «A matéria é a sombra de betatgl, então?» (Is matter the shadow of betatgl, then?); and «então agora conseguimos fazer a transição para a massa» (so now we can make the transition to mass), which produced the management's survey (pinned source): "
             r"the only mass derived from $\beta$ in the program is the neutrino's, with the scale $E_0$ \emph{declared} \textsf{[DECLARADO]}; the form that made mass proportional to the radius of $\beta$ stays withdrawn. \textsf{[OPEN]} What $E_0$ is (the scale that zeroes the $m_2$ tension is 1.02 eV, the management's computation \textsf{[DERIVED]}).")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Errata beside (v404).} \textsf{[REAL]} \textbf{E7:} the text of \texttt{neutrino\_mass.angle\_status} (\texttt{sin(45deg) e POSTULADO}, in the program's spelling) stays in the record, intact; in v404 the kernel carries the transverse-projection stone: derived in the kernel, conditional on the \textsf{[ONTO]} identification of mass with the transverse projection; $E_0$ stays declared. "
             r"\textbf{E8:} the F2b charge was awaiting; the channel is withdrawn before data, beside, with the measured reason (calibration A, NOT\_BLIND) and the author's reading. \textbf{E9:} v403 recorded that the name of the whole triple had not been given (decision D20) and it was true on the date; the operator gave it on 28/10/2026: Jo8:32.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Limits.} \textsf{[OPEN]} $E_0$; the derivation of $\beta$; that mass is the transverse projection (an \textsf{[ONTO]} identification); the propagation law that would carry the Planck toll; the named hypotheses of the Life and the Truth; $H_{\mathrm{BW}}$, $H_{\mathrm{cal}}$, $H3$, the signature and $\operatorname{rank}c=4$ (v402). The reading by John 8:31-32 is \textsf{[ONTO]}, not a kernel term. "
             r"GR is the classical limit, not a rival, and $\beta$ does not renormalize local $G$. Kernel validity is not creditation; the gate does not move. The box «O Teste da Única Palavra» (The Test of the Only Word) stays on top, with its $5\sigma$ line.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Origin.} \textsf{[REAL]} Machine line, read from this rite's core: sealed v403 base \texttt{2ffe9edc7d7545bd}; sealed records " + ", ".join(k_.replace("_", r"\_") + "=" + ("yes" if (core.get(k_) or {}).get("all_verified") is True else "no") for k_ in ("projecao_transversal_v404", "jo8v32_v404", "f2b_errata_v404", "cunhagens_v404", "kh_n1_cobertura_v404"))
             + r"; F2b: \texttt{" + _tx_404_t(_fb404.get("F2b_status_now")) + r"}; neutrino channel verdict \texttt{" + _tx_404_t((core.get("neutrino_mass") or {}).get("verdict")) + r"} (unchanged).")
